1
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,920
Brighten things up and try stepping back.

2
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:28,660
Like someone is calling out, a rainy
afternoon after the rain has stopped.

3
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:35,300
Walking while looking back,
my hand held by Mom.

4
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:42,420
That strange feeling I felt back then.

5
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:47,700
So on the tiles of the arcade street,

6
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:53,480
I tried walking only on the black ones.

7
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,660
Everyone was a child once,

8
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,800
but everyone has forgotten.

9
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:09,080
Politicians with their self-important faces,
and aunties with blue eyeshadow too.

10
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:14,660
Go on, turn at that corner.

11
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:19,880
You can meet everyone, everyone.

12
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:27,780
Over there, there are turtles.
Surely there are turtles.

13
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:33,080
Everyone, come on over to our town!

14
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:34,560
Thank you.

15
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:39,200
Hyper Cop Re-Up

16
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:44,360
Affiliated Police: Hyper Cop

17
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:49,480
a special police force created to fight the
evil criminal organization of purse snatchers

18
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:51,280
That's Hyper Cop.

19
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,040
To protect the peace of the Earth,

20
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:56,200
the five Hyper Cops keep
fighting today as well.

21
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:00,560
Our company's going to release the show's toys,
you know.

22
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:04,480
Look, our company's name
is even on the poster.

23
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,360
Really.

24
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:09,160
That's great.
With this, your company will go major too!

25
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,140
When does this start?

26
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:12,720
Starting next month.

27
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:16,820
It airs every Monday from
4:00 to 4:05 in the morning.

28
00:02:16,820 --> 00:02:18,800
Five minutes, from 4 a.m.

29
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,660
That's when everyone's asleep!

30
00:02:20,660 --> 00:02:22,820
Though my grandpa's up at that hour.

31
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:24,380
It's a children's show, right?

32
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:27,220
This is the toy they'll
be selling with the show.

33
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:29,360
This is the prototype for the Arbu.

34
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:32,900
Hurricane Perch.

35
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,280
What's a grown man doing with that?

36
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:40,620
It has a built-in computer and
responds to movement and voice,

37
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,900
so it makes all kinds of sounds.

38
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:45,240
There was a similar toy back in the day.

39
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,880
When you unleash your finishing move,

40
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:49,420
you spin your arm four times like this.

41
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:50,860
Isn't that just a rip-off of that?

42
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:54,160
Don't lump it together with that thing.

43
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:56,780
My finishing move is much more impressive.

44
00:02:57,780 --> 00:02:59,080
This time too, 35 times!

45
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,480
Take this, take this, take this, take this!

46
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,060
And then from behind, 20 times!

47
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,780
Again, 15 times!

48
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,900
And then 7 and a half times backward!

49
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:15,300
And 5 times forward again!

50
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:16,920
It's like a safe, isn't it.

51
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:19,080
It looks like it's quite a strain, though.

52
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:23,700
Special Hurricane Punch!

53
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:28,320
W-well, how is it?
Quite the powerful sound, right?

54
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,780
Yeah, well,

55
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:35,400
it's not just the arms,
there are legs and a belt too.

56
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:38,420
When you combine all of them,
it becomes a Hyper Suit,

57
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:40,860
and you can play all
sorts of other ways with it.

58
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:43,380
Alright, let me try it out for you.

59
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,440
Auto-lock has been activated.

60
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:59,640
When you put on the Hyper Suit, it locks automatically,
so it's built that way.

61
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,940
so it won't come off easily.

62
00:04:01,940 --> 00:04:04,300
I see, it's well made.

63
00:04:11,420 --> 00:04:12,880
It's pretty cool, too.

64
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:15,460
It's a bit heavy, though,
that's the drawback.

65
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:18,380
It has a powerful motor built in, after all.

66
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:21,140
And this is the instruction manual.

67
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:23,960
It's as thick as a phone book.

68
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:27,760
Alright, let's start by trying
this so-called Hyper Claw.

69
00:04:28,420 --> 00:04:30,360
Raise your right hand to 75 degrees,

70
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:35,080
then spin it forward 365 times at full force,
one rotation every 0.5 seconds.

71
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,560
You're really going to do 365?

72
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:41,080
At the 250th,
add ten kicks with the right leg too.

73
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:45,191
Then extend the bar above your head,

74
00:04:45,241 --> 00:04:47,820
stand on your toes,
and spin your whole body ten times.

75
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:54,300
Stick two pencils up your nose,
and scoop the front with a gal's rhythm.

76
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:01,620
That hardly looks like a hero's move at all.

77
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:05,200
Finish by striking from the inside,
gouging in.

78
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:08,620
See? Perfect.

79
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:09,740
What the hell is this?

80
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:12,120
Then, for all that tedious
setup you made me go through,

81
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:14,120
the sound effects are pathetically lame.

82
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,660
Th-you think so?

83
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,760
I thought it was fun, though.

84
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:21,460
For starters, 365 repetitions
at the beginning is way too many.

85
00:05:21,460 --> 00:05:23,100
Kids will get exhausted!

86
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,620
No way, no way!
This product will never sell!

87
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:30,540
A-actually,
the Hyper Suit has one more feature.

88
00:05:30,980 --> 00:05:33,680
It's a voice sensor function on the back.

89
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,240
A voice sensor?

90
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:38,960
You know, heroes have all
sorts of signature poses, right?

91
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:41,020
Hyper Attack!

92
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:42,600
Hyper Fighting!

93
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,420
Hyper Carnival!

94
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:47,120
Now you can do those easily.

95
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:48,460
How?

96
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:52,460
You shout loudly and this
voice sensor catches the sound.

97
00:05:54,300 --> 00:05:54,960
Pose!

98
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:04,180
I see, so it moves with spring
power from the whole body.

99
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:07,640
The pose automatically
resets after 10 seconds.

100
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,060
Why didn't you just tell me
to use this from the start!

101
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:11,940
Uh, yeah, right.

102
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:14,640
Alright, let's try the others too.

103
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:17,280
Is there one where five
of them do it together?

104
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:19,920
Well, Hyper Cop has five members, after all.

105
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:23,660
Actually,
we've got prototypes ready for everyone.

106
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:28,400
Alright, you guys put these on too.
We're going to try this pose.

107
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:30,860
Why should we have to -

108
00:06:30,860 --> 00:06:32,440
We have to wear it, you know.

109
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:34,660
That's right, we're on duty, senior.

110
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:36,860
Is that how you're going to be about it?

111
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:40,920
Listen, this guy's company has the nerve,

112
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:43,120
teaming up with a TV station, and all.

113
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:47,140
trying to sell toys at a time like this!

114
00:06:47,140 --> 00:06:48,940
Just take a look at that product, would you?

115
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:56,400
I think it wouldn't hurt to give them a hand.
Isn't that what a police officer beloved by the citizens is supposed to do?

116
00:06:56,920 --> 00:07:02,500
Come on, you say something too.
"Would you all please kindly cooperate with us?"

117
00:07:02,500 --> 00:07:07,660
The fate of our company rides on this product.
Please, I beg you.

118
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:16,080
Alright, if that's the case,
we'll be happy to cooperate.

119
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:24,760
Somehow,

120
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,720
pretty good,

121
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,100
it's looking nice, isn't it?

122
00:07:27,660 --> 00:07:30,800
Ryo-san,
there's one extra figure left over, though.

123
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,300
Don't worry about it.

124
00:07:32,300 --> 00:07:33,780
I've already taken care of it.

125
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,320
Ryo-sama, my good sir!

126
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,080
What's going on?

127
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:41,240
Honda, we've been waiting for you!

128
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:43,620
Wow, amazing!

129
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:48,720
Special-effects heroes
usually ride motorcycles, right?

130
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:54,060
I've always admired them.
Okay, let's start with the basic poses!

131
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,780
Hyper Red!

132
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:58,420
Hyper Blue!

133
00:07:59,180 --> 00:08:00,920
Hyper Pink!

134
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:04,200
Hyper Yellow!

135
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,580
Hyper Blush!

136
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:10,320
All five together: Hyper Cop,
reporting for duty!

137
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:16,840
Wow, you all look great!
It's exactly like the TV show!

138
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:19,420
Okay, next is the group pose!

139
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:20,400
Here we go.

140
00:08:20,860 --> 00:08:22,120
Are we doing it here?

141
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,980
Maybe you'd better not.

142
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:28,160
You can't escape the noisy sensor function!

143
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,020
Hyper Pyramid!

144
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,820
Are you all right, Ryo-san?

145
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:41,700
That's why I said you shouldn't!

146
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:45,020
The Hyper Pyramid won't work
in a narrow place like this.

147
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:49,040
This'll do.

148
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,960
Here we go.

149
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,960
Hyper Pyramid!

150
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:02,340
Hyper First

151
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:05,240
Hyper Force

152
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:08,280
Hyper Totem Force

153
00:09:09,420 --> 00:09:11,320
Hyper Snake

154
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:13,860
Hyper Ten

155
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:16,980
Hyper Kanenoko Walk

156
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:20,000
Hyper Chinese Acrobats

157
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Hyper Swimmer

158
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,760
Hyper Yoga

159
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,560
This one's pretty interesting

160
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:31,520
I'll monitor it for a while,
so you can leave it here.

161
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:34,100
Really? That'd be a big help.

162
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:36,220
Then I'm counting on you.

163
00:09:36,220 --> 00:09:37,460
Leave it to me.

164
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:40,680
Now, what pose should I strike next?

165
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,000
Are you still going at it, senpai?

166
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,080
You've done enough already, right?

167
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:48,400
We should get back to work soon.

168
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:50,440
I'm heading back to the police box.

169
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,120
Hyper Through!

170
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:56,100
Hey, Ryo-chan, what are you making me do?

171
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:59,980
Anyway, Hyper Through is a Hyper Pink pose,

172
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,660
so I just had you try it.

173
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:05,080
Tch.

174
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,860
Hyper Shape!

175
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:13,960
This one's also a pink-only pose,
so I had you try it.

176
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:19,520
Hand over that instruction manual.

177
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,800
Hyper Bandai.

178
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,620
Hey, it's Ryotsu Kankichi!

179
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:28,540
Didn't you give that up, Ryo?

180
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:31,640
This...

181
00:10:33,220 --> 00:10:34,220
Hyper Komaneci.

182
00:10:34,220 --> 00:10:35,000
No way.

183
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,000
Hyper Ein.

184
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,160
How embarrassing.

185
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:39,980
Hyper chon-wa, chon-wa, gue gue.

186
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,040
What?

187
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,900
Hyper chichikuri-pambo, gyuu.

188
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,120
Nooo! Argh, enough already!

189
00:10:45,860 --> 00:10:47,540
Hyper... ibinai... squeeze!

190
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:49,880
Hyper, no, no!

191
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,440
Hey, wait up!

192
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,700
That's totally not okay!

193
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:55,900
Yay! Tomato-chan, let her go!

194
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:56,960
No way!

195
00:10:57,140 --> 00:11:01,700
Hyper... Tsuchikuri-pambo... squeeze!

196
00:11:01,700 --> 00:11:04,480
Hyper, komanechi, tomanechi!

197
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:07,860
Mom's nagging!

198
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:12,300
Give me a break!

199
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,140
Now do you know how it feels?

200
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:25,320
Senpai,
we really do have to get back to work.

201
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:28,300
We can't keep the police
box open forever, either.

202
00:11:28,820 --> 00:11:32,100
This is an automatic lock, right?
How do you get it off?

203
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:34,640
What's with you lot? You're no fun at all.

204
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:36,740
Yes!

205
00:11:37,100 --> 00:11:39,580
How to release the automatic lock...

206
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:41,660
Release, release, release... found it!

207
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:45,480
Rotate your right hand 300 times
while punching 100 times with your left.

208
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,640
Then 150 bunny hops.

209
00:11:49,140 --> 00:11:51,260
Next, 80 bunny hops.

210
00:11:51,260 --> 00:11:54,280
And finally, 200 Hindu squats!

211
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:57,060
No way!

212
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,480
Is that the only way?

213
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:02,780
Looks like it.
This seems to be the only way.

214
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:05,680
No way.

215
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:09,140
Now this is interesting.

216
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,060
Anyway, we just have to do it.

217
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:16,680
This is pretty tiring.

218
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,520
My arm's swelling up.

219
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:20,140
Hang in there, Honma.

220
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:23,380
No, if you quit halfway, you'll have
to start over from the beginning.

221
00:12:25,740 --> 00:12:27,240
Just a little more, hang in there.

222
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,200
Hyper Fighting Pose!

223
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,740
What are you doing, Ryo-chan?

224
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:34,380
Did I do something?

225
00:12:42,580 --> 00:12:44,820
Just a little more, everyone.
Let's give it everything!

226
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,040
Ryo-chan!

227
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:01,960
Why do you keep getting
in the way like this?!

228
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,160
Not really.

229
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:06,800
This is hard enough as it is,
so stop being mean!

230
00:13:07,020 --> 00:13:10,400
Hmph, that's only because
you lot have no stamina.

231
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:13,020
For me, this is a piece of cake.

232
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:15,540
Then prove it.

233
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:17,660
Alright, just watch.

234
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:23,100
Hey, easy, easy, there we go,

235
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:25,260
and we're almost done, there.

236
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:28,560
Hyper Psycho Pose!

237
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:31,820
Come on, Reiko.

238
00:13:31,820 --> 00:13:33,540
That's your cue, from before.

239
00:13:33,540 --> 00:13:34,160
Damn it!

240
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,720
But that's nothing to me.

241
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:07,540
Thank you for watching.

242
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:10,280
As expected of a senior.

243
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:12,160
Your stamina is astonishing.

244
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:19,180
In the end, the only way out is
to take it apart and remove it.

245
00:14:19,180 --> 00:14:22,140
Only Ryo-san could get out of it that way.

246
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:23,960
By the way, where's Ryo-chan?

247
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:27,600
What are you doing, Senpai?

248
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:30,120
I'm upgrading the Hyper Suit's power.

249
00:14:30,620 --> 00:14:32,680
Reinforcing the motors
and springs in each part,

250
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:35,860
and using five powerful lithium batteries.

251
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:44,940
Are you going to add more? You can't modify the product without permission!
It's an improvement, we're making it better than before.

252
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:54,560
Auto-lock is on. Now, grab a golf club.

253
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:56,380
Hyper Tee Shot!

254
00:14:56,380 --> 00:15:03,100
An ideal form swing, I see.
And in tennis, too!

255
00:15:03,100 --> 00:15:05,380
Hyper Smash!

256
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:08,220
Hyper Home Run!

257
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:11,660
Hyper Ping-Pong!

258
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:16,520
For wrestling fans, we've incorporated
Mexican luchador wrestling.

259
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,700
Hyper Luchador!

260
00:15:23,740 --> 00:15:26,460
Senpai, that hurts! Let go!

261
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:31,820
With this, anyone can instantly
become a sports superstar!

262
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:40,480
It'll sell to adults too, just like you said, senpai.
Herb tea, anyone? Ooh, herb tea, nice.

263
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:46,900
I mean herb tea. If it's tea, just say tea!
You lot use way too many foreign words.

264
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:50,880
Here's your herb tea.

265
00:15:54,580 --> 00:15:56,220
What happened to you, senpai?

266
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:59,120
The suit went and did the
Hyper Pearl Tea pose on its own.

267
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:04,400
Why did you suddenly strike that pose?

268
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:07,680
Reiko, what did you say just
now when you served the tea?

269
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:10,840
I think you said "Hyper Herb Tea."

270
00:16:14,160 --> 00:16:15,200
I knew it.

271
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,785
Right, the senpai's suit...

272
00:16:16,835 --> 00:16:21,740
It mistook Reiko's "Hyper Herb Tea
" for "Hyper Pearl Tea"!

273
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:27,680
Sorry.

274
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,700
I turned the voice sensor up too high.

275
00:16:32,250 --> 00:16:34,340
We're in Tsurukame Prefecture.

276
00:16:35,220 --> 00:16:37,420
Oh right, I ordered takeout.

277
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:39,200
Here you go, Pākō-men.

278
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:43,220
Why are you standing up, Senpai?

279
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:51,440
Sorry. Let me explain. Hyper Comment is Hyper
Red's move for when he makes a mistake or fails.

280
00:16:51,440 --> 00:17:00,500
Until yesterday, it was a terrifying move where you punch yourself. This time I misheard
"Hyper Comment" as "Hyper Gomen."

281
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:07,040
Hyper Comment and Hyper Gomen do sound alike.
Hyper Gomen is a terrifying move, you know.

282
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:09,940
Hey! Stop saying
"Hyper Gomen" over and over!

283
00:17:09,940 --> 00:17:16,920
Ahhh! Senpai, you got hit in the eye.
You should take that suit off.

284
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:19,400
It's dangerous, you know.
Yeah, you're right.

285
00:17:22,360 --> 00:17:26,225
100 days, 100 days, 100 days,
100 days, 100 days, 50 days,

286
00:17:26,275 --> 00:17:27,980
60 days, 60 days, 100 days,

287
00:17:28,030 --> 00:17:30,460
60 days, 100 days, 200 days, 200 days

288
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:33,980
Hey, why won't it unlock?

289
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:36,260
Its response is getting sluggish.

290
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:37,940
It's because you go and modify it.

291
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,360
Alright, one more time.

292
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,180
200 days

293
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:46,840
200

294
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:50,420
It's not coming off, is it?

295
00:17:50,420 --> 00:17:52,000
Don't tell me it's broken.

296
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,560
Oh no, what a disaster.

297
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:10,220
Fine, shall we take it apart?

298
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:11,080
Well, that's -

299
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,500
You should've said that sooner!

300
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,260
Alright, here goes.

301
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:16,140
Yeah, hurry up.

302
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:23,120
What's going on?

303
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:26,160
It broke because you modified
it without permission.

304
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:28,680
If it's come to this,
I'll pry it off by force!

305
00:18:33,020 --> 00:18:36,100
W-what happened this time?

306
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,200
Ow

307
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:46,520
Whoa! It's the E-kan!
Now it's the Double Hyper God Hand!

308
00:18:47,420 --> 00:18:48,400
Senbai!

309
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:54,500
My head's going to get crushed!

310
00:18:55,600 --> 00:18:56,740
No good!

311
00:18:57,160 --> 00:19:00,060
Hyper Fighting Pose!

312
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,360
Phew, I'm saved!

313
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:06,660
I see, so that's an option!

314
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:08,040
As expected of Reiko-san!

315
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:13,260
Now it's the Hyper Comment switch!

316
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,460
Hyper Fighting Pose!

317
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:17,260
Saved!

318
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:20,560
When things get dangerous, we've got no
choice but to strike this pose, right?

319
00:19:25,660 --> 00:19:26,700
Is everyone here?

320
00:19:26,700 --> 00:19:28,080
Chief.

321
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:31,120
Ryotsu!
What are you doing at a time like this!

322
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:34,560
You think I want to be doing these poses?

323
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,560
What happened, Chief?

324
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:40,400
A bank robbery. The robbers
took the cash and are on the run.

325
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:43,580
Understood.

326
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:47,100
Ryotsu, you too.
Hurry up and get that toy off.

327
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,540
If it came off easily,
we wouldn't be having this trouble.

328
00:19:56,620 --> 00:19:57,680
They're coming this way.

329
00:19:58,460 --> 00:19:59,680
Block the road.

330
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:00,320
Hah.

331
00:20:08,860 --> 00:20:10,460
Oh no, this is terrible!

332
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:14,420
Let me show you the power of this toy.

333
00:20:14,420 --> 00:20:15,880
Hyper Sprint!

334
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:21,380
I see.

335
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:25,100
So that's another way to use it.

336
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:27,100
It really is a genuine Hyper Cop.

337
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,600
We got away!

338
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:32,660
What?

339
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,260
I won't let you get away.

340
00:20:36,260 --> 00:20:38,040
Hyper Shock!

341
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:40,780
Hurry!

342
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,140
Like hell I'll let you get away!

343
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:54,640
Hyper Sprint!

344
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:58,680
You're under arrest!

345
00:21:02,120 --> 00:21:02,840
Damn it!

346
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:05,560
The Hyper Tee Shot switch got turned on!

347
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:07,980
No way!

348
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:12,020
Hyper Fighting First!

349
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:14,880
The game's...

350
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,760
Oh crap!

351
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,500
Damn it!

352
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:27,880
The Hyper Home Run switch got turned on!

353
00:21:31,380 --> 00:21:33,360
Hyper Fighting Perspective!

354
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,920
Hyper Sprint!

355
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:38,240
Ano, home run show!

356
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:44,220
That cop's been yelling
something this whole time.

357
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:47,920
Hyper Tackle!

358
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:51,980
Making us go to all this trouble!

359
00:21:52,520 --> 00:21:53,080
You're under arrest!

360
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,940
Hyper Fighting Pose!

361
00:21:54,940 --> 00:21:55,480
What?

362
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,220
So that's it, after all.

363
00:21:59,220 --> 00:22:01,920
So it's set up to strike
that pose whenever you shout.

364
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,040
You bastard!

365
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:05,000
Hyper Fighting Pose

366
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,240
Hyper Fighting Pose

367
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:07,840
Hyper Fighting Pose

368
00:22:07,840 --> 00:22:09,780
You'd better stay right there, got it?

369
00:22:09,780 --> 00:22:10,420
Bero bero

370
00:22:10,420 --> 00:22:11,060
Boo boo

371
00:22:11,060 --> 00:22:14,860
Damn it! Hyper Sprint!

372
00:22:15,900 --> 00:22:18,440
Crap! The pose is stuck!

373
00:22:20,700 --> 00:22:24,600
Nekkun! Wait!

374
00:22:29,520 --> 00:22:31,180
Hyper Sun...

375
00:22:32,420 --> 00:22:33,991
This is,

376
00:22:34,041 --> 00:22:36,880
Hyper Sun!

377
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,656
key feature,

378
00:22:37,706 --> 00:22:44,320
Hyper Sun is an ultimate special move that rams the
strongest enemy with jet propulsion and self-destructs!

379
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:47,500
You don't seriously think it'll
actually self-destruct, do you?

380
00:23:02,820 --> 00:23:03,520
They're getting away!

381
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:11,200
Wow, the Hyper Suit seems to be a huge hit

382
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,700
What huge hit?

383
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:16,900
Putting a self-destruct device on a toy,
seriously, what were they thinking!

384
00:23:17,420 --> 00:23:21,220
Well, at least the toy company's
president got his big break, right?

385
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:23,820
There are way too many safety issues!

386
00:23:24,220 --> 00:23:26,180
Ryo-san, are you okay?

387
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:27,260
Hey!

388
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:30,620
Because of you, I went through hell!

389
00:23:31,180 --> 00:23:32,960
Sorry, sorry.

390
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:36,440
Hyper Cop got great ratings, you know.

391
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:38,680
They've even decided on a Part 2.

392
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:41,680
So, as the second installment
of the Hyper Suit series,

393
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:44,320
we made something called
the Hyper Suit Deluxe.

394
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,720
Hyper Suit Deluxe?

395
00:23:47,040 --> 00:23:49,080
Test it for us again this time, Ryo-san.

396
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:51,820
Don't be ridiculous,
I'm absolutely not doing it.

397
00:23:52,560 --> 00:23:53,400
Ryo-san.

398
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:56,500
Hyper Suits are already worn out and rough.

399
00:24:04,520 --> 00:24:05,600
My fingers are killing me, ow ow

400
00:24:07,340 --> 00:24:10,460
Anyway, once I've drawn the eyebrows,

401
00:24:10,460 --> 00:24:13,980
dash to the station, dash, dash, dash!

402
00:24:14,480 --> 00:24:16,160
On the packed train,

403
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:19,620
a nap on the back of the way home.

404
00:24:20,960 --> 00:24:23,360
Thanks for your hard work this week too.

405
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:25,900
The rubber seller is quite right.

406
00:24:27,100 --> 00:24:30,620
Holding a baguette in one hand,
looking all composed,

407
00:24:30,620 --> 00:24:33,320
a beef bowl with cloudy, extra-saucy broth.

408
00:25:00,820 --> 00:25:04,500
Thank you for watching.

409
00:25:04,520 --> 00:25:09,120
I love you, every day is no play.

410
00:25:09,120 --> 00:25:13,100
Hearts are flying, Monday.

411
00:25:13,520 --> 00:25:16,580
Harem, harem, four bull.

412
00:25:19,860 --> 00:25:21,200
I'm starving.

413
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:24,620
Why do we have to skip meals and go
through a health checkup like this?

414
00:25:24,620 --> 00:25:27,640
Once it's over,
we're all going out for yakiniku, right?

415
00:25:27,640 --> 00:25:29,660
Let's just get it over with quickly.

416
00:25:29,660 --> 00:25:31,860
Me? I'm the very picture of health,
head to toe.

417
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:33,840
It'll be over in a flash.

418
00:25:34,520 --> 00:25:37,880
Next time, Ryo-san goes to the human dock.
See you then!

419
00:25:38,560 --> 00:25:44,700
That place is Kameari. Well, surely Kameari.

420
00:25:45,460 --> 00:25:49,080
Everyone, come on over to our town!

421
00:25:50,300 --> 00:25:50,740
Thank you!

